1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
MCP deleted its own handshake.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,677
The July 2026 spec

3
00:00:03,677 --> 00:00:04,923
removes the handshake.

4
00:00:04,923 --> 00:00:05,830
It also removes

5
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:07,167
the session ID.

6
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:07,890
So how does

7
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:10,057
a server know who's asking?

8
00:00:10,067 --> 00:00:11,345
A session works like

9
00:00:11,345 --> 00:00:12,380
a hotel key card,

10
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:13,476
good for one room.

11
00:00:13,476 --> 00:00:14,937
Now every request shows

12
00:00:14,937 --> 00:00:16,100
a passport.

13
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,390
Inside are its protocol

14
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:18,411
version and client

15
00:00:18,411 --> 00:00:19,467
capabilities.

16
00:00:19,467 --> 00:00:20,668
A wrong version gets

17
00:00:20,668 --> 00:00:22,833
an unsupported version error.

18
00:00:22,833 --> 00:00:24,227
Need state across calls?

19
00:00:24,227 --> 00:00:25,330
The server creates

20
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:26,899
a handle. The client passes

21
00:00:26,899 --> 00:00:27,770
it as a normal

22
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:29,133
tool argument.

23
00:00:29,133 --> 00:00:30,642
Illustrative: a tool needs

24
00:00:30,642 --> 00:00:32,259
the user to choose.

25
00:00:32,259 --> 00:00:33,120
The server returns

26
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,800
an input required result.

27
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:35,840
Then the client sends

28
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:36,927
the same request again,

29
00:00:36,927 --> 00:00:38,233
with the answers.

30
00:00:38,233 --> 00:00:40,342
Roots, sampling and logging

31
00:00:40,342 --> 00:00:41,287
are deprecated,

32
00:00:41,287 --> 00:00:42,733
but still work.

33
00:00:42,733 --> 00:00:44,671
So each request explains

34
00:00:44,671 --> 00:00:46,939
itself. State becomes explicit

35
00:00:46,939 --> 00:00:47,699
handles.

36
00:00:47,699 --> 00:00:49,700
Questions become a retry loop.

37
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,110
Would you miss the handshake?

38
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,133
Tell me below.

